{"id":"9d543b3de707b0de","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-ground-trs.md","title":"基项重写系统","display":"df-ground-trs — 基项重写系统","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-ground-trs","aliases":["56-df-ground-trs"],"display":"df-ground-trs — 基项重写系统","depends_on":["[[56-df-ground-terms]]","[[56-df-rewrite-system]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), §3.4.1, printed p75","source_ocr_block":"96","source_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-ground-trs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-ground-trs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground-trs — 基项重写系统"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eccf433851609ffb\" href=\"?note=eccf433851609ffb\" title=\"56-df-ground-terms\">56-df-ground-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §3.4.1, printed p75"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"96"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，基项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\">\\(G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eccf433851609ffb\" href=\"?note=eccf433851609ffb\" title=\"56-df-ground-terms\">56-df-ground-terms</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land R\\subseteq G\\times G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{GroundTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land R\\subseteq G\\times G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §3.4.1（印刷 p75，OCR 页块96）。规则两侧都是基项；这与任意 TRS 的基项片段不同。即使规则为空也允许该谓词，不能额外假定必有闭项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-ground-terms","status":"resolved","id":"eccf433851609ffb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-ground-terms","status":"resolved","id":"eccf433851609ffb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，基项集合 $G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)$ 见 [[56-df-ground-terms]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundTRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land R\\subseteq G\\times G.","display":true}],"bytes":887,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-ground-trs.md]]"}],"outgoing":["eccf433851609ffb","a6c29a8d098ef0ed"]}